  "scope": "Constitutive inversion, observation, reconstruction, conditional energy identities, global existence and uniqueness for globally Lipschitz Hilbert fields, and actual finite-matrix split iteration with O(1/n) convergence. This is not a continuum limit, a dimension-uniform bound, or a closed solution of general periodic nonlinear PDEs. This branch also includes an additive finite relative-energy rate cancellation and coercivity lemma, not yet a chain-rule or PDE result.",
